    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b30ccd0531b30fb8d100",
      "document_start": 38,
      "document_end": 58,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 1;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_837f396fde0dacec0162",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 79,
      "text": "# 2.1.2 质点系统动力学基础方程;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c74ecc75d52c97d34272",
      "document_start": 80,
      "document_end": 112,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b7f1e4ab2ee5012c17cf",
      "document_start": 114,
      "document_end": 135,
      "text": "分析动力学的基础是达朗伯原理和虚位移原理。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_88f49e844d88a0df1287",
      "document_start": 135,
      "document_end": 170,
      "text": "达朗伯原理引入惯性力的概念，用解决静力平衡问题的方法来处理动力学问题。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7e70d33fb38f0652b94f",
      "document_start": 170,
      "document_end": 209,
      "text": "虚位移原理引入虚位移和虚功的概念，给出了处理非自由质点系平衡问题的最普遍方法。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_157431c196ad05f8df22",
      "document_start": 209,
      "document_end": 226,
      "text": "将这两个原理结合起来，可以推导出质",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_663ac8ef98cbe75ceb72",
      "document_start": 228,
      "document_end": 248,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_10990a9ecf712ccaa2ca",
      "document_start": 249,
      "document_end": 253,
      "text": "# 1.",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3a1fa54f273d14f2ac72",
      "document_start": 254,
      "document_end": 262,
      "text": "动力学普遍方程;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_38376cd7e9131948cb57",
      "document_start": 263,
      "document_end": 295,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6dfb5038ca3170819327",
      "document_start": 297,
      "document_end": 353,
      "text": "式（2-21）表明，在任意瞬时，具有理想约束的质点系所受的主动力和惯性力在任意一组虚位移中所做的虚功之和等于0。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_57ab058c02da7332f4c6",
      "document_start": 353,
      "document_end": 381,
      "text": "该方程称为动力学普遍方程（又称为达朗伯-拉格朗日方程）。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5e35a09dbb8c6719df07",
      "document_start": 381,
      "document_end": 397,
      "text": "它可以用来解决动力学的各种问题。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8420830110b06419f14f",
      "document_start": 397,
      "document_end": 413,
      "text": "式（2-21）是一个有广泛用途的",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ead9e47262c8d7eb2166",
      "document_start": 415,
      "document_end": 435,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4b2ac10032dcf365b8f6",
      "document_start": 436,
      "document_end": 440,
      "text": "# 1.",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a01d91a86de4d4574512",
      "document_start": 441,
      "document_end": 449,
      "text": "动力学普遍方程;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_af39d0db71b76da7f5a3",
      "document_start": 450,
      "document_end": 482,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ce70951a8889b34808d6",
      "document_start": 484,
      "document_end": 505,
      "text": "（2）主动力系中除包含外力外，还包含内力。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e69e923e34559ca02d4e",
      "document_start": 505,
      "document_end": 559,
      "text": "因为在动能定理中已经指出，一般情况下，内力做功之和不一定为0，同样内力在虚位移中所做的虚功之和也不一定为0。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_03e21c8fdd40b636a668",
      "document_start": 561,
      "document_end": 581,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_df843314d32af1951300",
      "document_start": 582,
      "document_end": 586,
      "text": "# 2.",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b1309492db546bd6760f",
      "document_start": 587,
      "document_end": 594,
      "text": "拉格朗日方程;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5e3312a0554ee07f75ee",
      "document_start": 595,
      "document_end": 627,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9dfc18a4245942a67350",
      "document_start": 629,
      "document_end": 709,
      "text": "动力学普遍方程式（2-21）是以直角坐标系表示的方程，由于系统约束的存在，所以在这个方程中各质点的虚位移一般不全是独立的，这样解题时需要找出各虚位移之间的关系。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6118dc4ff15c6f89fdfd",
      "document_start": 709,
      "document_end": 771,
      "text": "如果从动力学普遍方程式（2-20）出发，加上约束条件，就可以将动力学普遍方程转化为用广义坐标系表示的形式，得到拉格朗日方程。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_51e869d0b7dd54c219bb",
      "document_start": 771,
      "document_end": 800,
      "text": "根据所加约束条件的不同，可形成第一类和第二类拉格朗日方程。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1c2250cafde2c52992e8",
      "document_start": 802,
      "document_end": 822,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1122e0ec4064de39842d",
      "document_start": 823,
      "document_end": 837,
      "text": "# 1）第一类拉格朗日方程;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3d3c1e78f5f831b0872b",
      "document_start": 838,
      "document_end": 870,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3f20b3c1e0f223c5acce",
      "document_start": 872,
      "document_end": 936,
      "text": "第一类拉格朗日方程是应用数学分析中的拉格朗日乘子法，将直角坐标投影形式的动力学普遍方程和约束方程相结合而形成的一组动力学方程式。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_548134a5d4e92d7ff201",
      "document_start": 938,
      "document_end": 958,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_92d69a72aca6a68c7070",
      "document_start": 959,
      "document_end": 976,
      "text": "# 2.2.1 多刚体系统动力学;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c265ed6f036703f5d3ce",
      "document_start": 977,
      "document_end": 1009,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0f2a5dd455a1996440c9",
      "document_start": 1011,
      "document_end": 1111,
      "text": "多刚体系统动力学是研究多刚体系统运动规律的科学，是一般力学面向工程实践的学科，它是从经典力学基础上发展起来的新学科分支，其根本点在于建立适宜于计算机程序求解的数学模型，并寻求高效、稳定的数值求解方法。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6a74fcc5761ffe8533e9",
      "document_start": 1113,
      "document_end": 1133,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 7;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_00dcf0c687104db94142",
      "document_start": 1134,
      "document_end": 1151,
      "text": "# 2.2.1 多刚体系统动力学;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_047334988abb8e9ffa6f",
      "document_start": 1152,
      "document_end": 1184,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e2176119d93d9b8196af",
      "document_start": 1186,
      "document_end": 1258,
      "text": "多刚体系统动力学的研究对象是由任意有限个刚体组成的系统，刚体之间以某种形式的约束连接，这些约束可以是理想完整约束、非完整约束、定常或非定常约束。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_09f03ca838d3c0cdf035",
      "document_start": 1258,
      "document_end": 1337,
      "text": "已经形成了比较系统和成熟的研究方法，主要有牛顿-欧拉法、拉格朗日方程法、图论方法（Roberson-Wittenburg，R-W方法）、凯恩方法和变分方法等。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2cc3c172d826a29c0947",
      "document_start": 1339,
      "document_end": 1359,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 8;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_681b3bac5c0003c72b21",
      "document_start": 1360,
      "document_end": 1371,
      "text": "# 1）牛顿-欧拉法;",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_417b14d74ca5f47c9d54",
      "document_start": 1372,
      "document_end": 1404,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_090caabdfba9377b7f04",
      "document_start": 1406,
      "document_end": 1423,
      "text": "牛顿-欧拉法是矢量力学的研究方法。",
      "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_85a791bae959a7bf53e4",
      "document_start": 1423,
