          "document_start": 977,
          "document_end": 1009,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 977,
          "end": 1009,
          "chunk_start": 977,
          "chunk_end": 1009,
          "sentence_document_start": 977,
          "sentence_document_end": 1009,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0f2a5dd455a1996440c9",
          "document_start": 1011,
          "document_end": 1111,
          "text": "多刚体系统动力学是研究多刚体系统运动规律的科学，是一般力学面向工程实践的学科，它是从经典力学基础上发展起来的新学科分支，其根本点在于建立适宜于计算机程序求解的数学模型，并寻求高效、稳定的数值求解方法。",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1011,
          "end": 1111,
          "chunk_start": 1011,
          "chunk_end": 1111,
          "sentence_document_start": 1011,
          "sentence_document_end": 1111,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6a74fcc5761ffe8533e9",
          "document_start": 1113,
          "document_end": 1133,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 7;",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1113,
          "end": 1133,
          "chunk_start": 1113,
          "chunk_end": 1133,
          "sentence_document_start": 1113,
          "sentence_document_end": 1133,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_00dcf0c687104db94142",
          "document_start": 1134,
          "document_end": 1151,
          "text": "# 2.2.1 多刚体系统动力学;",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1134,
          "end": 1151,
          "chunk_start": 1134,
          "chunk_end": 1151,
          "sentence_document_start": 1134,
          "sentence_document_end": 1151,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_047334988abb8e9ffa6f",
          "document_start": 1152,
          "document_end": 1184,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1152,
          "end": 1184,
          "chunk_start": 1152,
          "chunk_end": 1184,
          "sentence_document_start": 1152,
          "sentence_document_end": 1184,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e2176119d93d9b8196af",
          "document_start": 1186,
          "document_end": 1258,
          "text": "多刚体系统动力学的研究对象是由任意有限个刚体组成的系统，刚体之间以某种形式的约束连接，这些约束可以是理想完整约束、非完整约束、定常或非定常约束。",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1186,
          "end": 1258,
          "chunk_start": 1186,
          "chunk_end": 1258,
          "sentence_document_start": 1186,
          "sentence_document_end": 1258,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_09f03ca838d3c0cdf035",
          "document_start": 1258,
          "document_end": 1337,
          "text": "已经形成了比较系统和成熟的研究方法，主要有牛顿-欧拉法、拉格朗日方程法、图论方法（Roberson-Wittenburg，R-W方法）、凯恩方法和变分方法等。",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1258,
          "end": 1337,
          "chunk_start": 1258,
          "chunk_end": 1337,
          "sentence_document_start": 1258,
          "sentence_document_end": 1337,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2cc3c172d826a29c0947",
          "document_start": 1339,
          "document_end": 1359,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 8;",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1339,
          "end": 1359,
          "chunk_start": 1339,
          "chunk_end": 1359,
          "sentence_document_start": 1339,
          "sentence_document_end": 1359,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_681b3bac5c0003c72b21",
          "document_start": 1360,
          "document_end": 1371,
          "text": "# 1）牛顿-欧拉法;",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1360,
          "end": 1371,
          "chunk_start": 1360,
          "chunk_end": 1371,
          "sentence_document_start": 1360,
          "sentence_document_end": 1371,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_417b14d74ca5f47c9d54",
          "document_start": 1372,
          "document_end": 1404,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1372,
          "end": 1404,
          "chunk_start": 1372,
          "chunk_end": 1404,
          "sentence_document_start": 1372,
          "sentence_document_end": 1404,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_090caabdfba9377b7f04",
          "document_start": 1406,
          "document_end": 1423,
          "text": "牛顿-欧拉法是矢量力学的研究方法。",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1406,
          "end": 1423,
          "chunk_start": 1406,
          "chunk_end": 1423,
          "sentence_document_start": 1406,
          "sentence_document_end": 1423,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_85a791bae959a7bf53e4",
          "document_start": 1423,
          "document_end": 1479,
          "text": "它将刚体在空间的一般运动分解为随其上某点的平动和绕此点的转动，分别用牛顿定律和欧拉方程处理，故称为牛顿-欧拉法。",
          "section_id": "section_40e873da7a66",
          "start": 1423,
          "end": 1479,
          "chunk_start": 1423,
          "chunk_end": 1479,
          "sentence_document_start": 1423,
          "sentence_document_end": 1479,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
